msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AB493704_366A_442B_BF09_C798E900D503"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫There were two things out of the ordinary about that baby."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫갓난아기의 기묘한 점은 ⟪k:36⟫두 가지였다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_FF583E4B_2A98_4F97_9A87_7B65836D3D81
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cfa40d1de50358f19a59ab246640ecc727ff9750444c0730846e9207f9f1913
#. default-sha256: 4a4995c0fc13decda6e38ec8fed707d6ffb92494731b610e7096b4779af2d8c7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_FF583E4B_2A98_4F97_9A87_7B65836D3D81"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The first its parents embraced—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫and the second they wholly rejected."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만 첫 번째는 받아들여졌으며, ⟪k:1⟫두 번째는 그렇지 않았다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2D5289D9_FFC3_4848_98C9_657B89C18CE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ea0f393b95d290254651869e1b1a578af238af22c46df4e9585d868ea11eb34
#. default-sha256: efaae816eb450da93c6d9163655ba7bb71a8b7137552f5d065d7c0a4bb6b7358
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2D5289D9_FFC3_4848_98C9_657B89C18CE2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Although,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫첨언하자면――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_4F790A1C_6400_4DCF_8E21_8AFF632FCA0D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f4b9412699ab5111cccefbbebd76caa174a2df0884c141eff5b00e2a2c2f0fe1
#. default-sha256: fc42086871bafc03e491962116300c9bc028beb0cedf7653f845f172156f12fb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_4F790A1C_6400_4DCF_8E21_8AFF632FCA0D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫it was some time before the baby’s second peculiarity emerged,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫갓난아기의 두 번째 차이점은 ⟪k:1⟫그 누구도 ⟪k:2⟫몰랐다."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5BC2A57D_E2A0_4E91_BF38_2D99F24490D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 95b1d59267e417afbe0aa89ed174d7b02f881b5bd05a8f7810ec5a195bd2ab59
#. default-sha256: 12f7a574fd7c0d1a372df5c88328464509fddec8a358cac82c22d110211995cd
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5BC2A57D_E2A0_4E91_BF38_2D99F24490D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫not even the child itself."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫당초에는 ⟪k:1⟫갓난아기 본인조차도."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D963F74B_3365_4AEA_9DF9_E5223184BAEC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1dd7a7c0dd1284502554e2cb98d75a4d098b4091f7ea86bfb602622391c03a91
#. default-sha256: 0d55856f35b0bc1553cf43661d49354ee570a34109bc81f61c1e2f69754f57ec
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D963F74B_3365_4AEA_9DF9_E5223184BAEC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Its mother surely enjoyed that brief period of happiness—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫갓난아기의 어머니는 ⟪k:1⟫훗날 답이 나올 때까지――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_A0D0F429_9D92_4E11_A050_0F2E050FB7EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 90f7dbba74484c5aed332debdfd24063fb0938bcfc258cc2897f557a933aad18
#. default-sha256: 69a1dce77a60ba855e586561c51d9685bbcd6acca8a8d4e738c3f18bb1b2965b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_A0D0F429_9D92_4E11_A050_0F2E050FB7EF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫before her child finally realized the truth."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫길지 않은 행복을 누렸으리라……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9A031404_A212_485A_951E_7A1AA5D74456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c93677f77028c4c33bb8d1c91aeb88a8768b87a0f66160f4a41a5a2da2acef1
#. default-sha256: 4d27d4ddbb1c73e6c8987764d65b5d1772cea7fc372a3e30208fa20085188374
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9A031404_A212_485A_951E_7A1AA5D74456"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Blind to the fact that the moment it had let out its first cry,⟪k:1⟫everything came crashing "
"down."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫갓난아기가 운 순간, ⟪k:1⟫모든 게 무너졌음을 모른 채로."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01104E12_C871_4BD4_A7BA_36E16748DA01
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b65c016f87ce302ed595762ef7594ee5b6b799c3e8a9ac1bdc36a9902b4b8bc2
#. default-sha256: 18468ae25ac238f3f545f4dbbcd0cdeece359335452e9a41d33035958aaf2183
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01104E12_C871_4BD4_A7BA_36E16748DA01"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫To this day, she still doesn’t ⟪k:1⟫know⟪k:2⟫ the child she gave birth to..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫천사를 악마로 바꾸고, ⟪k:1⟫인간을 마녀로 만들어, ⟪k:2⟫저주를 낳았단 사실을……"

#: scenario7:scenario7_E2145377_DA66_4D2D_BD1F_344ABAC574D6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 166b9a081a6f7d2177e833bc155dbc34aa636af2e9b89c0c03bce1f9ce51b76e
#. default-sha256: 51f3d383702c278a3f9c3bf064a15f181d829779a23f52e05f48abddb511311e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E2145377_DA66_4D2D_BD1F_344ABAC574D6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That she set loose a curse upon the world—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a curse that turned angels into demons, "
"humans into witches."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫어머니는 끝내 몰랐다……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5D454F0D_ABB4_4F08_A58E_2B1384E97A17
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 63a00165f37cc748fdb59d28936de794f25acab7dbed2d8d086a71ee5446443c
#. default-sha256: 0d40fc6f119fc5b7c6d537b857c987aecd6fe50363906ded7ad407bf5661150d
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5D454F0D_ABB4_4F08_A58E_2B1384E97A17"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫My god, look at that..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫오오……, ⟪k:5⟫이건……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_E4A05C7E_B25F_4801_9F09_491FC019AAB7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7177b1278a9e6b44e06cc1cb6cd8e0ae095d443c0028c7226871575769433962
#. default-sha256: 53db2eea3a14c493a957582fc8a4cea87b51f5e5a85b5234522674d07e9ffd4c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_E4A05C7E_B25F_4801_9F09_491FC019AAB7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehe, she’s beautiful, isn’t she?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Have you seen her laugh?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫후후, ⟪k:1⟫예쁘고 건강한 아이지요? ⟪k:2⟫여보, ⟪k:3⟫이 아이가 웃는 걸 보셨나요?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_EB215257_53C5_4C4C_B147_5C722FC7FF77
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3e679b6d7f0c7566c78fcdeb24ce4f7846c92f8918008ec4cf4595df16614f97
#. default-sha256: ed0f195f8246423b7603e3d08b16879446ff4f0a5818cccf0b14ba302f4a049c
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_EB215257_53C5_4C4C_B147_5C722FC7FF77"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not yet, I haven’t.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At any rate... ⟪k:3⟫that color certainly is something else..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫아니, ⟪k:1⟫아직이야.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그나저나…… 이 외모는…… ⟪k:4⟫허어 참……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_05CAE79F_BC9E_45D4_B455_6D79A02884C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb82098099c2e5776d7eefe95956392a542909efa86e5515ed4bf0553a398aee
#. default-sha256: 4c2ff01118c4a8315db4827305d903a4b5d2f4ae4bf7229bcb4f0f6c9a094a99
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_05CAE79F_BC9E_45D4_B455_6D79A02884C7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫God’s gift to us.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No... ⟪k:3⟫she’s an angel sent from Heaven."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫주님께서 내려 주신 거예요. ⟪k:1⟫아뇨…… 어쩌면 ⟪k:2⟫이 아이는 천사의 화신일 수도 있겠네요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_AFCDEE38_469F_4572_863D_FCBC6C7959A6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e5997ca7d7e4ce912b1e19c4046e45e4fbbd8887d54490481b90f36ee0cabe0
#. default-sha256: 4465e2c4e89d72bd40b32bd0e5df127f098df0f968c0295b6924d6c07e676577
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_AFCDEE38_469F_4572_863D_FCBC6C7959A6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫An angel...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ah, yes. I can see it now, Lydie."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫천사라……. ⟪k:1⟫음, ⟪k:2⟫그렇겠군, ⟪k:3⟫리디 말이 맞겠어."

#: scenario7:scenario7_9391D6D2_7A8F_49EF_8D12_343DE250AFC9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3cd29ce66255198b19a9989e0534319d63140d33466b54aba1851665099e40c3
#. default-sha256: 27d2bcf8830d8fa0b9edbb5a0e57dcc58026528179e0ac652d2da1e160c8b174
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_9391D6D2_7A8F_49EF_8D12_343DE250AFC9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Her white hair and almost translucent skin, it’s beautifu—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫이 백발과 ⟪k:1⟫새하얀 피부도 ⟪k:2⟫아름답게 보이――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_ABF564EC_5EB3_403E_9847_61FB8C7E726A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e8b15410e16f3957c1b45b1a487c886773eb7d6741a2d6ccc259041fd19570e8
#. default-sha256: 4d342bf5eec96f6153e1ab8a14fb806d7d96c3285d06ed899a19f79147758572
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_ABF564EC_5EB3_403E_9847_61FB8C7E726A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………!"

#: scenario7:scenario7_BFB2B8B6_B695_446E_AF6A_3EA9B1F732A5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24873b7825134eb006316bb8958d28a30f217e03d66e4c125eb2208c86317d6b
#. default-sha256: 55442b5f26f7dff8e358aef9bb286be31461bb9d78e0d63770c03b51cb379d4b
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_BFB2B8B6_B695_446E_AF6A_3EA9B1F732A5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My, she opened her eyes!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Maybe she felt you nearby.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Hehehe, do you like "
"your father more than me?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Is that it, sweetheart?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫어머, ⟪k:1⟫눈을 떴네요! ⟪k:2⟫아버지가 온 걸 안 걸까요?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫후후후, ⟪k:5⟫나보다는 아버지"
"가 좋니?"

#: scenario7:scenario7_F8F2E1E7_3348_48D2_977D_FF8F38BC7924
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a475112e2b6f342c4fdeff9555e720be0c43e8a097d885a7cc617ee1c4cd537
#. default-sha256: de1011c61e05f1c403469b5d177fb6a26738e85c398a02011cd120e39a722ddb
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F8F2E1E7_3348_48D2_977D_FF8F38BC7924"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Gorgeous, aren’t they?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Such a deep, enchanting color... ⟪k:3⟫like two little jewels."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫눈이 참 아름답지요? ⟪k:1⟫넋이 나갈 만큼 맑은 게……⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫꼭―― 보석 같아요."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F190F5DC_48FE_440B_BF8C_68F58FEE3D2A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 88bb504b4c88757ce88f8889b74927cd0c6bda8b9170d29ac803681489a8afd1
#. default-sha256: 5605f568705b34415ebaf953acbdb58268a4eb08e1eb8337f0a36e0deb53fc50
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F190F5DC_48FE_440B_BF8C_68F58FEE3D2A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫that they are..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫그……, ⟪k:1⟫그렇군……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_D755C27D_2B08_4EF0_9E3F_D5D3FD28FB28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a4c3c253829bb848b73daf2aab86ce90186c73a441215c5564585ee7143941b5
#. default-sha256: ac78e68ef0479a6f10950a3c1eeb5f954dcfd1d6fb33be29248b78ac3b6d9249
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D755C27D_2B08_4EF0_9E3F_D5D3FD28FB28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫A magnificent shade of red."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫붉은 눈――"

#: scenario7:scenario7_D20CBA4A_60EF_4509_A3E0_F5DE489EB604
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 50cad61a45b38d940134fd4ecc783d688d206ada3e1bdb67683ef7db98edb7ac
#. default-sha256: 34d87feb328647dabd11ab7e4952a143ad1d914d21144a2ee7f4cf223299852f
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_D20CBA4A_60EF_4509_A3E0_F5DE489EB604"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I-⟪k:1⟫I’ve never seen anything like it!⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And this is our child..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫서, ⟪k:1⟫설마 ⟪k:2⟫이런 아이가 태어날 줄이야!⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫이거 참…… 별일도 다 있어……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_01647F2F_AA7A_4236_A0AA_423B06884CC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d11986cf4ac2fa73e01d2534363cc04951e165bd0dad8f9987b8d49a3b6ab797
#. default-sha256: 277ce07eb32ed6f88f5cd17d2bc2a07f41820d3a99114d889c861aaf126de922
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_01647F2F_AA7A_4236_A0AA_423B06884CC0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She’s special... ⟪k:1⟫I can feel it.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫We have to take good care of her."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫특별한…… 아이일 거예요. ⟪k:1⟫애지중지 키워야겠어요……."

#: scenario7:scenario7_5CE11DD7_EE47_43F6_B22A_83804E20EED6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e28fea787554cb5bb4e7e13ac364c4ea21f5203fa2c0cbdef478df310b95695c
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_5CE11DD7_EE47_43F6_B22A_83804E20EED6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6695B475_B4E7_426F_B473_1770F2C607AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 15ddd378a886d183f8e135e6ae83dee462874c3a23ecf3b8b0b3893bdfd7192e
#. default-sha256: d2f1bb734bedd745d263516922b15feac1b430c99107110198a3420ce4deb472
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_6695B475_B4E7_426F_B473_1770F2C607AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She needs a name—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫one that’s just as special as her.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Have you already "
"chosen, Antonin?"
msgstr ""
